OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother dry day today with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine across the area.
OL,7,FFeeling noticeably cooler than of late
OL,8,Fthough, as a strengthening westerly
OL,9,Fbreeze develops throughout the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FLargely dry overnight with
OL,12,Fclear spells for many. Just a very
OL,13,Fsmall chance of the odd shower moving
OL,14,Finto the northwest of the region. A
OL,15,Ffresher and more comfortable night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FRemaining largely dry with
OL,18,Fspells of sunshine, although the
OL,19,Fsunshine maybe rather hazy at times.
OL,20,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,21,FAugust.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
